WEBVTT

01:21.310 --> 01:26.890
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.590 --> 01:29.810
[Episode 36]

01:33.710 --> 01:34.840
Jiuheng

01:35.350 --> 01:37.200
dared to go against me?

01:39.759 --> 01:40.840
To put it bluntly,

01:41.920 --> 01:44.650
it's only because he has His Majesty
backing him.

01:45.310 --> 01:47.590
The Li family

01:47.590 --> 01:49.710
finally has a decent emperor.

01:51.710 --> 01:52.710
It's just that...

01:53.229 --> 01:54.430
he's a bit impatient.

01:54.870 --> 01:56.479
He always wants to take over the reins.

01:56.479 --> 01:57.710
How would he know?

01:57.710 --> 02:00.510
In this court
where it's robbing Peter to pay Paul,

02:00.950 --> 02:02.270
how could

02:02.840 --> 02:04.310
a wet-behind-the-ears kid

02:04.310 --> 02:05.440
possibly handle it?

02:05.560 --> 02:06.490
Prime Minister,

02:06.840 --> 02:08.250
in my opinion,

02:08.680 --> 02:09.880
it's understandable

02:10.190 --> 02:11.710
that His Majesty is still young

02:11.710 --> 02:13.120
and doesn't fully appreciate your efforts,

02:13.120 --> 02:15.030
but Chen Yanyun is truly despicable.

02:15.030 --> 02:16.079
He has squandered the years

02:16.079 --> 02:18.190
you spent carefully cultivating him.

02:18.190 --> 02:21.000
You even entrusted him
with the care of His Majesty.

02:21.000 --> 02:21.860
Unexpectedly,

02:22.430 --> 02:23.470
in the end,

02:24.910 --> 02:26.950
he proved to be ungrateful.

02:27.280 --> 02:29.430
He even led His Majesty astray.

02:32.750 --> 02:35.079
Since I have the ability to cultivate him,

02:35.840 --> 02:37.440
I also have the ability to...

02:48.030 --> 02:48.840
Keqian, you're here?

02:48.840 --> 02:49.240
Hurry.

02:49.800 --> 02:50.870
Prepare a pot of my finest tea

02:50.870 --> 02:52.270
for the Grand Secretary.

02:52.750 --> 02:53.120
Yes.

02:53.590 --> 02:55.470
Thank you, Xuanweng.

02:56.870 --> 02:58.670
I heard something interesting,

02:59.240 --> 02:59.980
so I came

03:00.080 --> 03:01.430
to report to you.

03:00.230 --> 03:04.460
[Candidate Register
for Imperial Tutors of the Hanlin Academy]

03:03.470 --> 03:04.190
This is...

03:04.630 --> 03:05.840
This is the newly released list
of candidates

03:05.840 --> 03:09.100
for the Hanlin Academy's
supplementary Imperial Tutors.

03:09.630 --> 03:11.080
Let me see.

03:11.080 --> 03:12.080
Is there anything wrong?

03:12.080 --> 03:13.590
Everything is fine.

03:14.030 --> 03:14.910
But...

03:15.630 --> 03:16.960
one person is missing.

03:19.150 --> 03:20.010
Who is missing?

03:20.590 --> 03:21.960
Chen Xuanqing.

03:25.390 --> 03:26.920
He really isn't on the list.

03:27.079 --> 03:28.579
I asked around.

03:28.630 --> 03:29.829
Guess what happened?

03:31.030 --> 03:33.490
He has been posted
to a provincial position.

03:33.750 --> 03:35.079
A provincial position?

03:35.120 --> 03:36.150
Anqing Prefecture.

03:36.150 --> 03:38.420
Jiuheng personally arranged it.

03:39.310 --> 03:40.120
Well...

03:40.430 --> 03:41.520
as everyone knows,

03:41.840 --> 03:44.150
Chen Xuanqing is Jiuheng's nephew

03:44.150 --> 03:45.800
whom he took in from outside.

03:46.750 --> 03:48.950
And he turned out
to be cut out for study.

03:49.190 --> 03:49.970
Therefore,

03:50.000 --> 03:51.910
Jiuheng placed high hopes on him.

03:52.560 --> 03:54.590
First, he was ranked 3rd
in the metropolitan examination,

03:54.590 --> 03:56.590
then he entered the Hanlin Academy,

03:56.800 --> 03:57.870
and shortly after that,

03:57.870 --> 04:00.130
he was sent on an envoy mission to Beiman.

04:00.310 --> 04:01.850
A dazzling rise.

04:02.750 --> 04:04.880
Everything was clearly set up for him.

04:05.680 --> 04:06.880
It's obvious Jiuheng

04:06.960 --> 04:08.470
was grooming him

04:08.470 --> 04:09.470
as a successor.

04:09.470 --> 04:10.690
But now,

04:11.430 --> 04:13.030
he's been demoted to Anqing.

04:13.910 --> 04:14.860
I suspect

04:15.080 --> 04:16.829
they have a falling-out—

04:17.070 --> 04:18.310
and a serious one

04:19.390 --> 04:20.680
at that.

04:27.750 --> 04:28.950
Interesting.

04:31.780 --> 04:35.240
[Mirror-like Stillness]

04:32.360 --> 04:33.480
As you said, I led men

04:33.480 --> 04:34.920
to the northern frontier.

04:34.920 --> 04:35.560
And

04:35.830 --> 04:37.120
we really did find traces

04:37.120 --> 04:38.980
of those Chunyuan Sect remnants.

04:40.000 --> 04:41.060
How many were they?

04:42.190 --> 04:43.560
The first group we found

04:43.830 --> 04:45.030
had about a dozen men.

04:45.720 --> 04:47.020
We followed the trail

04:47.159 --> 04:48.360
and kept uncovering more.

04:48.360 --> 04:49.800
The handprints you told me about

04:49.800 --> 04:51.159
turned out to be very useful—

04:51.159 --> 04:52.210
without them,

04:52.310 --> 04:53.830
we would never have noticed.

04:53.830 --> 04:55.360
What were they doing there?

04:56.070 --> 04:57.830
The poor worked as coachmen,
boatmen, shop clerks, and porters,

04:57.830 --> 04:59.120
while the wealthy ran inns and businesses—

04:59.120 --> 05:00.780
people from all walks of life.

05:01.920 --> 05:04.380
Have you found any clues
about their leader?

05:05.310 --> 05:06.110
Third Master.

05:07.310 --> 05:08.870
We're family. Don't be so polite.

05:08.870 --> 05:09.800
Please sit down.

05:12.270 --> 05:13.000
Go on.

05:14.000 --> 05:15.800
I also asked about their leader.

05:16.600 --> 05:18.560
They say the leader of Chunyuan Sect

05:18.560 --> 05:19.690
is very mysterious.

05:19.950 --> 05:21.550
No one has ever seen his face.

05:21.870 --> 05:22.430
However,

05:22.750 --> 05:23.630
I also got

05:23.630 --> 05:24.830
some important news.

05:25.240 --> 05:27.480
After Prince Chengqing's rebellion
failed back then,

05:27.480 --> 05:28.830
the cultists of the Chunyuan Sect

05:28.830 --> 05:30.120
were able to flee from the capital

05:30.120 --> 05:31.250
all the way to Beiman

05:31.390 --> 05:33.320
because someone was funding them.

05:35.159 --> 05:35.800
Who?

05:36.310 --> 05:37.510
They say it was a woman

05:38.070 --> 05:39.200
called Lady Weirui.

05:41.270 --> 05:42.390
Lady Weirui?

05:43.070 --> 05:43.830
I've never

05:43.850 --> 05:45.050
heard of this person.

05:46.430 --> 05:47.040
My Lady.

05:49.600 --> 05:50.159
My Lady.

05:50.390 --> 05:51.920
It's a letter from Miss Xue.

05:54.950 --> 05:56.000
[Meet me at the silk shop at midnight tonight.
Bring Lord Chen with you.]

05:56.000 --> 05:58.530
[I have something to ask you.
Don't tell anyone. Remember.]

05:59.360 --> 06:00.480
Qinglan said

06:00.680 --> 06:01.950
she wants to see us.

06:04.310 --> 06:07.230
[Ji's Silk and Satin]

06:06.630 --> 06:07.560
Sorry to disturb you late at night.

06:07.560 --> 06:08.760
I'll cut to the chase.

06:09.070 --> 06:10.270
What leads have you found

06:10.270 --> 06:11.560
on the Chunyuan Sect?

06:15.070 --> 06:16.070
Haven't you been

06:16.070 --> 06:18.000
investigating this with Ye Xian?

06:18.630 --> 06:19.890
Why didn't you ask him?

06:19.920 --> 06:20.630
I did.

06:21.000 --> 06:22.000
He didn't tell me.

06:22.310 --> 06:23.430
I have my own reasons

06:23.430 --> 06:25.160
for looking into the Chunyuan Sect.

06:25.160 --> 06:25.890
Don't worry.

06:26.270 --> 06:27.400
I won't tell anyone.

06:27.480 --> 06:29.310
And I won't do anything against you.

06:29.310 --> 06:30.160
In fact,

06:30.630 --> 06:31.560
our goals

06:31.560 --> 06:32.310
are the same.

06:33.630 --> 06:34.760
If I'm not mistaken,

06:35.159 --> 06:36.360
you want to know

06:36.360 --> 06:38.020
the leads on the Chunyuan Sect

06:38.120 --> 06:39.000
because of

06:39.560 --> 06:40.560
your late mother.

06:42.870 --> 06:43.830
I heard that

06:44.600 --> 06:46.280
she was killed

06:46.520 --> 06:48.980
by Chunyuan Sect cultists
over 10 years ago.

06:50.240 --> 06:51.300
What are you doing?

06:51.560 --> 06:53.360
That was supposed to be a secret.

06:53.600 --> 06:54.750
How did you find out?

06:54.750 --> 06:55.950
As a Grand Secretary,

06:56.750 --> 06:57.510
I naturally

06:58.680 --> 07:00.240
know more than most people.

07:00.870 --> 07:01.680
Otherwise,

07:02.070 --> 07:03.310
why do you think

07:03.800 --> 07:04.510
I was confident leaving you

07:04.510 --> 07:05.830
by Ye Xian's side?

07:07.630 --> 07:08.310
Qinglan.

07:12.500 --> 07:13.760
I was right—

07:14.830 --> 07:16.600
you've been hiding your true abilities.

07:16.600 --> 07:17.120
Yes.

07:17.750 --> 07:19.020
I asked you about this

07:19.070 --> 07:20.310
because of my mother.

07:21.390 --> 07:22.310
Back when Chunyuan Sect

07:22.310 --> 07:24.630
was helping Prince Chengqing
launch his rebellion,

07:24.630 --> 07:26.720
their influence in the capital was vast.

07:26.720 --> 07:28.510
Many officials and their families

07:28.510 --> 07:29.640
were assassinated.

07:30.560 --> 07:32.630
My mother was one of them.

07:33.630 --> 07:34.560
She drank

07:34.560 --> 07:35.720
poisoned tea

07:37.040 --> 07:38.310
and died despite all efforts to save her.

07:38.310 --> 07:39.950
Have you found any clues?

07:40.480 --> 07:41.560
If I had,

07:41.560 --> 07:43.560
would I still need to come asking you?

07:43.560 --> 07:44.560
But I do know this—

07:44.950 --> 07:46.750
the person who poisoned my mother

07:46.750 --> 07:48.750
must have been someone close to her.

07:50.159 --> 07:52.159
Judging from what you said, it seems

07:52.310 --> 07:54.170
you already have someone in mind.

07:54.390 --> 07:55.040
You should know

07:55.040 --> 07:56.440
more about this than I do.

07:57.560 --> 07:58.159
So tell me—

07:58.720 --> 08:00.140
who is really behind

08:00.270 --> 08:01.160
Chunyuan Sect?

08:01.430 --> 08:02.490
It's only a theory,

08:02.600 --> 08:04.130
with no solid evidence yet.

08:04.480 --> 08:06.740
Wang Xuanfan and his wife died suddenly.

08:07.120 --> 08:08.250
That day,

08:08.510 --> 08:09.360
Zhao, Ye Xian,

08:09.870 --> 08:10.510
and I were all there

08:10.510 --> 08:11.910
when we saw their bodies.

08:14.270 --> 08:15.430
So you suspect

08:15.430 --> 08:17.230
the person behind Chunyuan Sect

08:18.680 --> 08:19.720
is my uncle?

08:20.310 --> 08:21.070
I told you.

08:22.180 --> 08:24.640
It's only a theory.
Nothing has been proven.

08:26.360 --> 08:26.890
Alright.

08:27.920 --> 08:28.680
I see.

08:30.160 --> 08:31.820
Thank you for telling me this.

08:31.830 --> 08:33.750
I owe you a favor.

08:34.080 --> 08:35.270
No need for that.

08:36.600 --> 08:37.530
What do you mean?

08:38.360 --> 08:39.820
You are my mentor's niece,

08:40.390 --> 08:42.630
the treasured daughter of the Xue family,

08:42.630 --> 08:43.630
but more importantly,

08:43.630 --> 08:45.290
you are a subject of Great Yan.

08:45.840 --> 08:47.320
I only hope that one day,

08:47.870 --> 08:48.440
when faced

08:48.440 --> 08:49.970
with matters of principle,

08:51.150 --> 08:53.010
you will know what choice to make.

08:54.990 --> 08:57.950
[The Heart as a Polished Mirror]

09:03.430 --> 09:08.300
♪ I ♪

09:10.150 --> 09:11.200
This clown role

09:11.080 --> 09:12.870
♪ Became a monk ♪

09:11.750 --> 09:13.210
looks somewhat familiar.

09:13.720 --> 09:17.110
♪ Suffered all kinds of oppression ♪

09:13.790 --> 09:15.440
I think I've seen him somewhere.

09:15.440 --> 09:17.080
You have no idea.

09:17.390 --> 09:19.390
This is Third Mr. Chen's nephew,

09:17.900 --> 09:22.840
♪ Beaten and scolded by my master ♪

09:19.510 --> 09:20.930
Chen Xuanqing.

09:23.550 --> 09:27.410
♪ So I ran away and went back home ♪

09:28.850 --> 09:32.310
♪ After two years ♪

09:30.570 --> 09:33.260
[The Heart as a Polished Mirror]

09:34.050 --> 09:37.680
♪ I grew my hair out ♪

10:58.440 --> 10:59.840
Senior Grand Secretary.

11:01.240 --> 11:02.170
I heard a few lines

11:02.170 --> 11:03.720
of your performance just now—

11:03.720 --> 11:04.550
very well.

11:06.320 --> 11:08.150
And your stage presence was excellent.

11:08.150 --> 11:09.600
Even after just one lesson,

11:09.600 --> 11:11.260
you're already this skilled.

11:11.270 --> 11:12.440
You're quite talented.

11:12.440 --> 11:13.970
I don't deserve the praise.

11:15.320 --> 11:16.390
If you don't want to be posted
to a provincial position,

11:16.390 --> 11:18.390
you should go to your uncle.

11:18.390 --> 11:19.240
Why...

11:19.440 --> 11:20.900
did you come to me instead?

11:22.270 --> 11:23.670
I did go to my uncle,

11:24.480 --> 11:25.740
but he firmly refused.

11:25.750 --> 11:26.360
Why?

11:29.910 --> 11:30.570
Because...

11:32.480 --> 11:34.270
I think I've stood out too much,

11:34.550 --> 11:35.950
and that displeased him.

11:36.750 --> 11:37.320
And I...

11:37.790 --> 11:39.240
am not really a son of the Chen family.

11:39.240 --> 11:40.360
I was adopted.

11:43.260 --> 11:44.990
You want to stay in the capital?

11:45.270 --> 11:45.920
Yes.

11:47.200 --> 11:48.000
Do you know

11:48.000 --> 11:49.140
that your uncle and I

11:49.240 --> 11:50.720
used to be teacher and student,

11:50.720 --> 11:52.550
but we have completely

11:53.200 --> 11:54.600
fallen apart?

11:56.960 --> 11:57.750
I know.

11:58.480 --> 11:59.120
That's why

11:59.120 --> 12:00.850
I had the courage to come to you.

12:06.480 --> 12:07.510
I may be unworthy,

12:07.720 --> 12:08.840
but I am loyal,

12:09.790 --> 12:11.550
and I am willing to work for you.

12:35.530 --> 12:36.440
That's good.

12:38.400 --> 12:42.510
[Linxia Restaurant]

12:43.360 --> 12:44.360
Miss Wanxue,

12:44.750 --> 12:46.550
you really can't drink any more.

12:49.080 --> 12:50.790
What should I do?

12:53.530 --> 12:54.000
My Lady.

12:54.000 --> 12:54.630
How is she?

12:54.630 --> 12:56.120
That's already her 2nd jar.

12:56.120 --> 12:57.320
I can't persuade her.

12:57.440 --> 12:58.510
Every time we tell her to stop drinking,

12:58.510 --> 12:59.570
she starts crying.

13:05.080 --> 13:06.170
Stop drinking.

13:12.600 --> 13:15.000
Why are you tormenting yourself like this?

13:15.240 --> 13:16.080
You know perfectly well

13:16.080 --> 13:17.670
that Chen Xuanqing
is not a good match for you.

13:17.670 --> 13:18.550
We're stopping you from marrying him

13:18.550 --> 13:19.630
for your own good.

13:27.030 --> 13:28.560
I told you to stop drinking!

13:29.360 --> 13:30.440
Give it to me!

13:30.910 --> 13:32.200
Give it to me!

13:33.750 --> 13:34.320
Ziling.

13:34.910 --> 13:35.630
Tell Eldest Young Master

13:35.630 --> 13:37.000
to send the carriage to the back door.

13:37.000 --> 13:37.910
Yes, My Lady.

13:43.200 --> 13:44.330
Let me send you back.

13:45.110 --> 13:46.560
No.

13:46.670 --> 13:47.290
Let's go!

13:47.320 --> 13:48.390
I'm not going back!

13:48.390 --> 13:48.960
Let's go!

13:52.120 --> 13:53.980
-I'm not going back.
-Be careful.

13:54.390 --> 13:55.910
I'm not going back!

13:55.910 --> 13:56.970
I'm not going back!

13:57.080 --> 13:57.670
No!

14:00.510 --> 14:01.870
Xuanqing?

14:04.930 --> 14:06.790
-Xuanqing!
-Where are you going?

14:07.600 --> 14:08.510
Xuanqing!

14:11.320 --> 14:12.120
Xuanqing!

14:12.120 --> 14:13.200
I'm Wanxue!

14:13.950 --> 14:15.190
Xuanqing...

14:20.480 --> 14:21.270
Xuruo?

14:24.240 --> 14:25.120
Xuanqing!

14:25.120 --> 14:26.250
Xuanqing, don't go!

14:26.510 --> 14:27.320
Xuanqing!

14:29.120 --> 14:29.800
Xuruo!

14:30.000 --> 14:31.120
Xuruo. Xuruo!

14:31.720 --> 14:33.010
Xuruo, don't go!

14:33.510 --> 14:35.770
Xuanqing! Xuanqing!

14:35.910 --> 14:37.360
Xuanqing!

14:37.750 --> 14:38.790
Stop shouting!

14:38.870 --> 14:40.150
He doesn't want to see you!

14:40.150 --> 14:40.690
It's good.

14:40.690 --> 14:42.390
We don't want to see him either!

14:42.390 --> 14:43.590
Send her back with me.

14:43.680 --> 14:44.960
Xuanqing!

14:44.990 --> 14:45.630
Come on.

14:45.720 --> 14:47.550
-Stop looking.
-Xuanqing!

14:47.550 --> 14:48.810
-Wanxue!
-Be careful.

14:50.000 --> 14:51.000
Don't go.

15:05.270 --> 15:06.960
Let's call it a day.

15:06.720 --> 15:09.280
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

15:10.200 --> 15:12.620
Your Majesty,
are you going to Wenhua Hall?

15:13.150 --> 15:13.730
Yes.

15:14.120 --> 15:15.320
Today is the Imperial Lecture.

15:15.320 --> 15:17.920
The Imperial Tutor
is going to test my studies.

15:18.480 --> 15:20.610
I'm very anxious right now.

15:21.670 --> 15:23.730
I haven't been paying much attention

15:23.740 --> 15:25.360
to Your Majesty's studies recently.

15:25.360 --> 15:28.230
Shall we summon the Lecturers
and attendants

15:28.320 --> 15:30.080
to Huangji Palace

15:30.390 --> 15:33.360
so that all officials may observe as well?

15:31.260 --> 15:33.970
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

15:34.440 --> 15:36.820
Mr. Fu, are you planning to test

15:36.960 --> 15:38.360
the Imperial Tutors first for me

15:38.360 --> 15:39.820
and take them down a notch?

15:40.150 --> 15:40.810
Zhang Fang.

15:41.720 --> 15:44.020
Summon the Lecturers to Huangji Palace.

15:43.760 --> 15:48.460
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

15:44.240 --> 15:45.630
Yes, Your Majesty.

15:49.360 --> 15:52.120
The Imperial Tutors are here!

15:58.800 --> 16:02.470
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

16:08.830 --> 16:11.990
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

16:10.030 --> 16:10.720
I'm Chen Xuanqing.

16:10.720 --> 16:11.640
-I'm Chu Junliang.
-I'm Li Rufei.

16:11.640 --> 16:12.870
Greetings, Your Majesty.

16:12.870 --> 16:14.960
Long live Your Majesty!

16:15.080 --> 16:15.810
Rise.

16:16.000 --> 16:17.400
Thank you, Your Majesty.

16:31.200 --> 16:32.060
Chen Xuanqing?

16:32.440 --> 16:33.550
How could it be you?

16:35.550 --> 16:36.460
Your Majesty,

16:36.750 --> 16:37.950
Lecturer Liu is sick.

16:38.000 --> 16:39.260
Director Wu ordered me

16:39.360 --> 16:40.360
to take his place.

16:41.670 --> 16:42.870
Very good, very good.

16:43.360 --> 16:45.220
The last time I saw you was when you

16:45.320 --> 16:47.720
returned from the envoy mission to Beiman.

16:47.870 --> 16:49.720
Half a year has passed.

16:50.630 --> 16:52.690
Your bearing has improved even more.

16:52.750 --> 16:53.840
Let's start

16:54.150 --> 16:55.200
with you today.

16:55.750 --> 16:57.150
Yes, Your Majesty.

16:58.670 --> 16:59.600
Today...

17:09.440 --> 17:10.310
Impeach?

17:10.560 --> 17:14.480
[Govern with Clarity from Above]

17:10.710 --> 17:11.700
My uncle?

17:12.349 --> 17:12.829
This...

17:13.510 --> 17:14.710
Impeach him for what?

17:15.270 --> 17:16.530
For moral corruption,

17:16.880 --> 17:18.030
domestic disorder,

17:18.240 --> 17:19.430
taking your wife,

17:19.550 --> 17:21.500
and disregarding human ethics.

17:21.720 --> 17:22.200
This...

17:25.200 --> 17:25.730
Where...

17:26.310 --> 17:27.810
Where did you hear that?

17:28.109 --> 17:29.310
That's not true.

17:38.440 --> 17:39.070
Yunting?

17:39.960 --> 17:40.900
Why are you here?

17:44.160 --> 17:45.750
Haven't you gone back to Chen Mansion?

17:45.750 --> 17:46.830
Why are you here?

17:47.310 --> 17:49.110
I didn't go back to Chen Mansion.

17:51.200 --> 17:51.930
I was...

18:00.270 --> 18:01.070
Young Master!

18:01.360 --> 18:02.760
I'm sorry!

18:02.910 --> 18:04.830
I'm sorry!

18:06.660 --> 18:07.720
They forced me,

18:08.790 --> 18:10.350
so I could only tell them.

18:11.110 --> 18:13.000
I was really afraid!

18:17.550 --> 18:18.480
What did you say?

18:19.030 --> 18:21.270
About Mrs. Wang.

18:23.000 --> 18:23.550
And...

18:24.160 --> 18:25.720
you and the Third Madam.

18:28.510 --> 18:30.540
I'm sorry!

18:31.110 --> 18:33.240
I didn't expect Tanhua

18:33.750 --> 18:35.070
to actually have the guts

18:35.070 --> 18:37.310
to try to kill someone.

18:38.270 --> 18:40.640
Impressive.

18:42.920 --> 18:44.110
What a pity.

18:47.880 --> 18:50.510
I have known Jiuheng
for more than 10 years,

18:51.070 --> 18:52.440
and I have never seen him

18:52.440 --> 18:54.030
take a woman to heart.

18:56.000 --> 18:57.200
I didn't expect this.

18:57.880 --> 18:58.940
As the saying goes,

18:59.030 --> 19:00.310
food from another pot
always tastes better—

19:00.310 --> 19:02.570
especially when it's your nephew's pot.

19:14.510 --> 19:15.510
Chen Xuanqing.

19:18.000 --> 19:19.680
His Majesty is asking you.

19:20.160 --> 19:20.830
Yes.

19:21.160 --> 19:24.020
Chen Xuanqing,
what do you intend to teach me today?

19:30.000 --> 19:30.960
Your Majesty,

19:31.200 --> 19:33.000
before I take on the duty
of your daily lecture,

19:33.000 --> 19:35.130
I would first like to impeach someone.

19:35.640 --> 19:37.100
Who do you wish to impeach?

19:37.270 --> 19:38.680
My uncle,

19:39.350 --> 19:40.350
Grand Secretary,

19:40.830 --> 19:43.890
Grand Secretary
of the Hall of Developmental Extreme,

19:45.790 --> 19:46.920
Chen Yanyun.

20:03.440 --> 20:05.840
We need to check
the drink orders every day.

20:06.510 --> 20:07.110
By the way,

20:07.400 --> 20:08.750
for regular patrons,

20:08.830 --> 20:09.720
you must mark the billing dates

20:09.720 --> 20:10.920
in red ink.

20:12.200 --> 20:12.680
Okay.

20:13.160 --> 20:13.790
Got it.

20:14.350 --> 20:14.830
Hya!

20:21.300 --> 20:22.130
Zhao!

20:24.550 --> 20:25.070
Madam!

20:26.070 --> 20:27.330
Mr. Jiang, you...

20:27.440 --> 20:28.480
Bad news.

20:31.830 --> 20:33.310
In the 34th year of Jingning,

20:33.310 --> 20:34.920
I met Gu Jinzhao

20:34.920 --> 20:36.200
at her coming-of-age ceremony.

20:36.200 --> 20:37.720
She accidentally fell into the water,

20:37.720 --> 20:38.270
and I

20:38.590 --> 20:39.550
saved her.

20:40.270 --> 20:43.030
From then on,
we developed feelings for each other.

20:43.030 --> 20:44.270
Who would have thought that,

20:44.270 --> 20:46.240
in order to curry favor with Chen Yanyun,

20:46.240 --> 20:47.110
the Ji family sent Gu Jinzhao

20:47.110 --> 20:49.030
to the capital as a gift for him.

20:49.880 --> 20:50.960
After he learned

20:51.310 --> 20:53.310
that Gu Jinzhao and I
had feelings for each other,

20:53.310 --> 20:56.640
Chen Yanyun used the metropolitan examination
to threaten me,

20:56.640 --> 20:58.030
and then forced me

20:58.510 --> 21:00.550
into an engagement with the Yu family.

21:00.550 --> 21:02.010
And later, while I was away

21:02.400 --> 21:03.830
on the envoy mission to Beiman,

21:03.830 --> 21:05.720
he forcibly took Gu Jinzhao as his wife.

21:05.720 --> 21:06.480
Nonsense!

21:06.580 --> 21:08.310
Mr. Chen is not that kind of man!

21:08.750 --> 21:09.480
I have notes

21:09.480 --> 21:11.340
from Gu Jinzhao herself as proof.

21:12.200 --> 21:13.000
Those notes

21:13.240 --> 21:15.040
were personally written by her.

21:15.400 --> 21:16.160
After I was

21:16.830 --> 21:18.590
forced into the engagement
with the Yu family,

21:18.590 --> 21:20.450
I had no choice but to return them,

21:20.480 --> 21:21.440
keeping only one

21:21.790 --> 21:22.680
as a keepsake.

21:24.960 --> 21:26.420
Even so, this alone proves

21:26.440 --> 21:27.400
that she and I

21:27.640 --> 21:28.440
had already

21:28.680 --> 21:30.880
pledged ourselves to each other first,

21:31.710 --> 21:32.970
and that Chen Yanyun

21:33.400 --> 21:34.730
later took her by force.

21:39.440 --> 21:40.920
If I have said even a single false word,

21:40.920 --> 21:41.480
may I

21:41.830 --> 21:43.400
die without a grave!

21:44.950 --> 21:45.470
You...

21:47.350 --> 21:49.080
Today is the Imperial Lecture.

21:49.110 --> 21:49.750
How did we

21:50.110 --> 21:52.000
end up discussing
an official's family matters?

21:52.000 --> 21:52.640
You should...

21:52.640 --> 21:53.440
Your Majesty.

21:54.310 --> 21:56.160
May I have a word?

21:56.510 --> 21:57.510
Please go ahead.

21:58.400 --> 21:59.590
I remember

22:00.480 --> 22:01.270
that day,

22:01.550 --> 22:03.480
when Jiuheng married Miss Gu,

22:04.510 --> 22:05.800
there was a case

22:06.440 --> 22:07.960
involving Ye Xian.

22:08.490 --> 22:10.550
Ye Xian attempted
to assassinate Chen Jiuheng

22:10.550 --> 22:11.350
on the street.

22:11.350 --> 22:12.860
They had a big fight.

22:13.480 --> 22:14.310
At that time,

22:14.750 --> 22:17.400
I even advised Jiuheng
that self-cultivation,

22:17.400 --> 22:19.510
family regulation, governance of the state,
and bringing peace to the realm

22:19.510 --> 22:21.160
are all interconnected and essential.

22:21.160 --> 22:21.880
But now,

22:22.160 --> 22:24.200
it has come to something like a dispute
over an uncle and nephew

22:24.200 --> 22:25.750
competing over a woman.

22:26.550 --> 22:27.310
I

22:28.030 --> 22:30.110
truly cannot understand it.

22:30.630 --> 22:31.710
Chen Xuanqing

22:32.000 --> 22:33.440
is Chen Jiuheng's nephew,

22:33.440 --> 22:36.310
whom he personally raised and taught.

22:37.550 --> 22:40.310
He's also the Tanhua personally selected
by the late emperor.

22:40.310 --> 22:40.790
For him

22:41.070 --> 22:42.480
to cast aside his dignity

22:42.830 --> 22:43.920
and future

22:44.270 --> 22:45.720
and speak so boldly here,

22:46.160 --> 22:47.310
it is clear

22:47.830 --> 22:49.490
he has been pushed to the limit

22:49.960 --> 22:51.720
and can no longer endure.

22:52.400 --> 22:54.860
Chen Jiuheng is guilty
of domestic disorder

22:55.200 --> 22:56.460
and moral corruption,

22:56.720 --> 22:58.790
and is unworthy of serving as a minister.

22:58.790 --> 22:59.480
As

23:00.000 --> 23:01.960
his mentor,

23:02.960 --> 23:05.030
I also bear responsibility.

23:07.350 --> 23:08.640
Your Majesty,

23:09.480 --> 23:10.480
please punish me.

23:19.520 --> 23:21.550
Chen Yanyun is morally corrupt

23:21.590 --> 23:22.920
and unworthy of serving as a minister!

23:21.610 --> 23:23.810
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

23:23.160 --> 23:23.920
Your Majesty,

23:23.920 --> 23:25.200
please punish him!

23:25.300 --> 23:27.580
Your Majesty, please punish him!

23:27.880 --> 23:28.340
This...

23:28.830 --> 23:30.230
Senior Grand Secretary,

23:30.550 --> 23:32.680
are you afraid
that I would refuse to plead guilty,

23:32.680 --> 23:33.310
so

23:34.310 --> 23:35.350
you have

23:35.590 --> 23:37.190
taken the blame on my behalf?

23:41.590 --> 23:42.400
Your Majesty,

23:43.000 --> 23:44.680
I have a question.

23:45.790 --> 23:47.070
As far as I know,

23:47.960 --> 23:50.270
Chen Xuanqing resigned

23:50.540 --> 23:52.440
from the Hanlin Academy over a month ago.

23:52.440 --> 23:53.700
So why is he here today,

23:53.830 --> 23:55.360
openly entering the palace

23:55.400 --> 23:58.240
in place of a Lecturer
to instruct Your Majesty?

23:59.440 --> 24:01.290
On whose orders did he come?

24:01.550 --> 24:03.720
Under what authority
did he enter the palace?

24:03.720 --> 24:05.440
And what exactly are the intentions

24:05.440 --> 24:07.000
of the person behind this?

24:07.680 --> 24:09.200
Lord Chen, there's no need

24:09.350 --> 24:10.510
for insinuations.

24:11.720 --> 24:12.880
I was the one

24:13.350 --> 24:15.150
who allowed him into the palace.

24:19.240 --> 24:20.040
Your Majesty,

24:20.680 --> 24:22.200
a few days ago,

24:22.550 --> 24:24.200
Chen Xuanqing came to me

24:24.720 --> 24:26.680
and told me

24:26.960 --> 24:28.220
all of his grievances.

24:29.350 --> 24:30.480
I pity him—

24:30.500 --> 24:32.130
he is an honored Tanhua

24:32.720 --> 24:34.160
who ought to serve the country,

24:34.160 --> 24:35.680
yet he has been suppressed

24:35.920 --> 24:37.450
over such a trivial matter.

24:37.830 --> 24:39.800
So I asked him then and there

24:40.270 --> 24:42.000
whether he dared
to confront Chen Yanyun in court.

24:42.000 --> 24:42.880
He said yes.

24:44.160 --> 24:44.880
Thus,

24:45.270 --> 24:46.590
I decided to let him enter the palace

24:46.590 --> 24:48.370
and give him a chance to speak.

24:48.590 --> 24:51.850
Mentor, you truly are filled
with righteous indignation.

24:51.910 --> 24:53.510
But Senior Grand Secretary,

24:54.640 --> 24:57.800
what you did has already violated
court regulations.

24:58.070 --> 24:59.720
Don't avoid the real issue.

25:00.550 --> 25:01.610
You must remember—

25:01.870 --> 25:04.530
rules cannot stand apart
from human sentiment.

25:06.110 --> 25:08.790
What a fine line.

25:09.200 --> 25:10.110
Chen Xuanqing!

25:10.590 --> 25:12.450
You are not a six-year-old child!

25:13.000 --> 25:16.330
You should understand the consequences
of acting this way!

25:22.530 --> 25:24.710
Are you threatening him?

25:25.000 --> 25:25.720
Mr. Chen,

25:26.090 --> 25:27.270
if you have anything to say
in your defense,

25:27.270 --> 25:28.160
speak freely!

25:29.110 --> 25:29.910
Your Majesty.

25:30.240 --> 25:30.790
I

25:31.400 --> 25:33.600
have a few questions for Chen Xuanqing.

25:34.640 --> 25:35.200
Go ahead.

25:41.790 --> 25:42.550
Xuanqing,

25:43.270 --> 25:45.880
did you come into the palace today
to impeach me

25:46.400 --> 25:47.680
of your own free will,

25:48.920 --> 25:50.400
or were you forced?

25:56.240 --> 25:57.520
Senior Grand Secretary.

25:57.520 --> 26:00.320
Senior Grand Secretary!
Senior Grand Secretary!

26:00.510 --> 26:02.070
It's not that I'm unwilling.

26:02.070 --> 26:03.070
It's just that...

26:04.270 --> 26:06.310
if I impeach my own uncle,

26:07.920 --> 26:10.250
it would be like a son
accusing his father.

26:10.270 --> 26:11.400
Even if it succeeds,

26:11.750 --> 26:13.880
my future would be completely ruined.

26:15.640 --> 26:16.770
Please forgive me—

26:17.200 --> 26:18.900
I truly cannot do it.

26:18.960 --> 26:20.480
You even killed a person.

26:20.550 --> 26:22.340
How can you talk about a future?

26:22.480 --> 26:23.200
Besides...

26:33.640 --> 26:35.650
[Second, Chen Yanyun deceived
the public by claiming]

26:35.650 --> 26:38.090
[that Chen Xuanqing was the son
of a collateral branch of the Chen clan.]

26:40.830 --> 26:42.750
The illustrious Tanhua,

26:43.270 --> 26:45.070
the nephew of a Grand Secretary,

26:45.160 --> 26:47.660
is actually the son of a river bandit.

26:47.750 --> 26:49.310
Marvelous.

27:00.680 --> 27:01.830
I came of my own will.

27:02.880 --> 27:04.220
No one forced me.

27:11.030 --> 27:12.630
You have a clear conscience?

27:13.550 --> 27:15.000
The son of a river bandit

27:15.310 --> 27:17.640
who posed as a common citizen,
sat for the imperial exams,

27:17.640 --> 27:19.300
and was even chosen as Tanhua—

27:21.240 --> 27:22.030
setting everything else aside,

27:22.030 --> 27:23.490
deceiving the Emperor...

27:25.640 --> 27:26.590
At best,

27:27.640 --> 27:28.750
you lose your rank.

27:28.770 --> 27:29.620
At worst,

27:30.160 --> 27:31.760
it's imprisonment or exile.

27:37.350 --> 27:39.400
And murder...

27:53.400 --> 27:53.990
Yes.

27:56.030 --> 27:57.920
Everything I said is true.

28:00.350 --> 28:01.590
You forced me.

28:05.350 --> 28:06.960
You really don't regret it?

28:09.000 --> 28:11.030
You've even played the clown—

28:11.200 --> 28:12.860
what are you afraid of?

28:13.920 --> 28:17.480
Rather than be silently crushed,

28:18.160 --> 28:19.820
you might as well take a gamble

28:20.200 --> 28:22.480
and leave your name before His Majesty

28:23.510 --> 28:24.790
and the court.

28:46.720 --> 28:48.310
I don't regret it.

29:02.590 --> 29:03.310
Alright.

29:06.400 --> 29:07.310
Good!

29:13.270 --> 29:14.070
Your Majesty,

29:14.590 --> 29:15.240
I...

29:15.590 --> 29:17.320
have finished my questioning.

29:17.480 --> 29:18.160
I...

29:19.270 --> 29:21.270
have nothing to defend myself with.

29:22.310 --> 29:23.240
Chen Xuanqing

29:23.790 --> 29:24.750
is ungrateful,

29:25.270 --> 29:26.920
disregards our family honor,

29:26.920 --> 29:27.920
speaks nonsense,

29:28.160 --> 29:29.680
and deceives Your Majesty.

29:29.680 --> 29:30.400
Yet I...

29:30.750 --> 29:33.080
still have to consider my wife and family.

29:35.310 --> 29:37.750
As for Chen Xuanqing's impeachment of me,

29:40.920 --> 29:42.000
I am not

29:42.160 --> 29:44.960
some oath-swearing rustic
from the countryside.

29:48.590 --> 29:49.400
I can only say

29:49.720 --> 29:50.880
that justice

29:51.310 --> 29:52.710
lies in people's hearts!

30:00.640 --> 30:04.030
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

30:35.440 --> 30:37.220
This is outrageous!

30:37.350 --> 30:38.350
Court dismissed.

30:38.720 --> 30:40.400
Mr. Chen, come with me.

30:40.790 --> 30:42.000
I will ask you

30:42.110 --> 30:43.510
what happened in detail.

31:02.030 --> 31:02.960
Great!

31:04.240 --> 31:05.070
Great!

31:08.160 --> 31:09.300
I, Chen Xuanqing,

31:09.680 --> 31:11.460
today in the Imperial Court,

31:11.830 --> 31:13.160
before His Majesty

31:13.160 --> 31:15.290
and all civil and military officials,

31:15.750 --> 31:16.550
exposed

31:16.550 --> 31:18.150
your true face, Chen Yanyun.

31:18.920 --> 31:20.120
What do I have to fear?

31:21.160 --> 31:23.090
What is there for me to be afraid of?

31:24.720 --> 31:25.680
Now even the Senior Grand Secretary

31:25.680 --> 31:26.920
stands on my side.

31:27.240 --> 31:27.890
I don't see

31:27.920 --> 31:29.200
what I have to fear.

31:34.070 --> 31:34.960
Chen Yanyun,

31:36.550 --> 31:38.270
blame only yourself

31:38.880 --> 31:40.280
for your immoral conduct

31:40.550 --> 31:42.010
and for pushing me too far!

31:46.350 --> 31:47.160
Now that I have

31:47.160 --> 31:49.350
the Senior Grand Secretary's support,

31:49.350 --> 31:51.210
I can rise swiftly to prominence.

31:52.790 --> 31:53.550
And you,

31:54.680 --> 31:55.590
Chen Yanyun,

31:56.240 --> 31:57.770
your reputation is ruined,

31:57.920 --> 32:00.120
and your official career is destroyed.

32:00.790 --> 32:02.480
You will be at my mercy.

32:12.160 --> 32:12.830
Who is it?

32:13.510 --> 32:15.640
Lord Chen, it's time to go.

32:50.310 --> 32:52.510
Of course he couldn't defend himself.

32:54.510 --> 32:56.760
As a Grand Secretary of the current court,

32:56.760 --> 33:00.270
being accused by his own nephew
of stealing his wife—

33:02.790 --> 33:04.750
whether true or false,

33:04.880 --> 33:06.200
once word spreads,

33:07.240 --> 33:10.030
it becomes a disgrace to the empire

33:10.350 --> 33:13.160
and a humiliation to His Majesty.

33:14.830 --> 33:17.440
Even if His Majesty wants to protect him,

33:18.750 --> 33:20.270
he won't be able to.

33:21.510 --> 33:22.720
You're right, Madam.

33:25.000 --> 33:27.960
I only feel sorry for Gu Jinzhao.

33:30.550 --> 33:31.940
She's clever by nature,

33:32.240 --> 33:34.000
yet of all people,

33:35.160 --> 33:36.620
she ended up with Jiuheng.

33:42.030 --> 33:42.590
Madam.

33:43.000 --> 33:44.110
Miss Lan is here.

33:44.830 --> 33:45.750
Lan?

33:47.200 --> 33:48.070
These days,

33:48.070 --> 33:51.200
she's been running around everywhere
with that Ye Xian.

33:51.400 --> 33:52.480
And now

33:53.310 --> 33:55.110
she remembers to come and see me?

33:56.240 --> 33:58.070
Chen Xuanqing took
the Senior Grand Secretary's side

33:58.070 --> 33:59.440
-and wanted to ruin the Third Master.
-Hya!

33:59.440 --> 34:01.070
If the Senior Grand Secretary finds out

34:01.070 --> 34:02.480
-about those files about the Penal Court
-Hya!

34:02.480 --> 34:03.440
hidden in the Ji Mansion,

34:03.440 --> 34:04.510
we'll be in trouble.

34:04.510 --> 34:04.920
Hya!

34:10.110 --> 34:11.360
Where did you

34:12.620 --> 34:14.110
hear this?

34:14.880 --> 34:16.280
Ye Xian was ordered to go to Xuan Mansion

34:16.280 --> 34:17.960
to investigate the remnants
of Chunyuan Sect.

34:17.960 --> 34:18.960
I went with him,

34:19.440 --> 34:21.900
and afterward
we split up to act separately.

34:21.960 --> 34:22.889
As it turned out,

34:23.320 --> 34:24.150
I really did capture

34:24.150 --> 34:25.960
a few Chunyuan Sect cultists.

34:26.400 --> 34:27.840
One of them claimed

34:28.190 --> 34:30.400
that even before
Prince Chengqing's rebellion,

34:30.400 --> 34:32.020
he saw you and my uncle with his own eyes

34:32.020 --> 34:33.780
at one of the cult gatherings.

34:37.000 --> 34:38.199
How is that possible?

34:38.800 --> 34:40.929
They must have been talking nonsense.

34:41.710 --> 34:42.630
But the man spoke

34:42.630 --> 34:43.630
with such detail

34:43.710 --> 34:45.480
that it was hard to tell truth from lies.

34:45.480 --> 34:46.880
Of course it was a lie.

34:50.710 --> 34:52.170
Then what do you plan to do?

34:52.320 --> 34:53.670
Nothing, of course.

34:55.000 --> 34:56.550
I've dealt with him.

34:56.670 --> 34:59.200
We can't let them
make baseless accusations.

35:01.230 --> 35:02.490
Then Ye Xian...

35:02.710 --> 35:03.640
He doesn't know.

35:08.480 --> 35:09.480
Qinglan,

35:10.280 --> 35:11.440
you did a good job.

35:12.320 --> 35:13.520
It wasn't for nothing

35:13.920 --> 35:14.670
that I've always treated you

35:14.670 --> 35:16.320
like my own daughter.

35:17.070 --> 35:18.470
Though anyone could tell

35:18.800 --> 35:20.280
the accusation was slander,

35:20.280 --> 35:21.030
still,

35:21.600 --> 35:22.930
fewer troubles

35:23.000 --> 35:24.600
are always better than more.

35:25.230 --> 35:25.960
Exactly.

35:27.800 --> 35:28.840
However, that man actually

35:28.840 --> 35:30.800
had the audacity to implicate you.

35:30.880 --> 35:32.280
He truly had a death wish.

35:32.710 --> 35:34.880
It must be that someone
was pulling the strings behind him.

35:34.880 --> 35:35.630
That person may even be

35:35.630 --> 35:37.760
an important figure in Chunyuan Sect.

35:39.110 --> 35:40.240
Rest assured, Aunt.

35:40.920 --> 35:43.030
I've already secretly ordered
an investigation

35:43.030 --> 35:44.550
and am following the trail.

35:44.550 --> 35:46.190
I will make sure the mastermind

35:46.190 --> 35:47.320
has nowhere to hide.

35:53.880 --> 35:55.210
You can investigate it.

35:55.840 --> 35:56.740
However,

35:57.030 --> 35:58.690
do not make a big fuss about it.

35:59.110 --> 36:00.370
After all,

36:00.480 --> 36:02.150
this concerns the remnants
of Chunyuan Sect.

36:02.150 --> 36:03.280
If it is made public,

36:03.440 --> 36:05.760
it won't do your uncle any good.

36:07.800 --> 36:09.630
If you find any clues,

36:09.880 --> 36:11.540
just report them to me in time.

36:12.840 --> 36:13.840
You are right.

36:14.230 --> 36:15.280
I will be careful.

36:20.280 --> 36:22.030
Get out! Get out!

36:27.360 --> 36:28.140
Mr. Chen,

36:28.480 --> 36:29.740
I was not being stupid.

36:30.360 --> 36:30.840
No,

36:31.550 --> 36:33.010
I was indeed being stupid.

36:33.030 --> 36:34.020
I originally considered

36:34.020 --> 36:35.510
that Chen Xuanqing was your nephew

36:35.510 --> 36:36.070
and even

36:36.070 --> 36:37.280
gave him a chance
to stand in the spotlight.

36:37.280 --> 36:38.150
Who would have thought

36:38.150 --> 36:39.400
that brat would defy authority

36:39.400 --> 36:40.730
and stab you in the back?

36:41.670 --> 36:43.190
I truly feel sorry for you.

36:45.230 --> 36:46.220
Your Majesty, please don't say that.

36:46.220 --> 36:47.790
I am too ashamed to face you.

36:48.110 --> 36:50.910
It's all my fault.
I didn't manage the family well.

36:51.960 --> 36:52.630
Although

36:53.030 --> 36:54.430
I did not expect my mentor

36:54.510 --> 36:56.310
to use Chen Xuanqing against me,

36:57.360 --> 36:58.190
fortunately,

36:59.190 --> 37:01.450
things have not gone too far from my plan.

37:02.440 --> 37:03.240
That's right.

37:04.070 --> 37:04.880
Whether

37:05.320 --> 37:06.920
Chen Xuanqing and Wang Xuanfan

37:06.920 --> 37:08.050
are involved or not,

37:08.070 --> 37:10.070
Mr. Fu will definitely suppress you

37:10.070 --> 37:12.200
and turn the court into his own domain.

37:12.320 --> 37:13.550
Matters such as abolishing frontier troops

37:13.550 --> 37:14.630
and cutting military expenses

37:14.630 --> 37:16.360
will all end up being decided
by him alone.

37:16.360 --> 37:18.000
I've expected all of this.

37:18.630 --> 37:19.360
If he

37:19.590 --> 37:20.280
truly has colluded

37:20.280 --> 37:21.610
with the Beiman people,

37:22.230 --> 37:24.190
do you think he will commit treason?

37:24.190 --> 37:25.000
What if...

37:25.360 --> 37:27.280
What if the Beiman people really invade…

37:27.280 --> 37:28.510
I don't think so.

37:28.760 --> 37:30.290
How can you guarantee that?

37:31.000 --> 37:31.800
Your Majesty.

37:32.880 --> 37:35.070
At present,
all of this is still speculation.

37:35.070 --> 37:35.630
There are

37:35.800 --> 37:36.590
only two things

37:36.590 --> 37:37.850
we urgently need to do.

37:38.440 --> 37:40.920
Thoroughly investigate all the remnants

37:41.000 --> 37:42.880
of Chunyuan Sect active within Great Yan.

37:42.880 --> 37:44.210
That's the first thing.

37:44.670 --> 37:46.670
And secretly win over
the military nobility

37:46.670 --> 37:47.600
as a precaution.

37:48.070 --> 37:49.130
That's the second.

37:50.630 --> 37:51.450
However,

37:51.510 --> 37:52.910
both of these must be done

37:53.360 --> 37:54.890
without my mentor knowing.

37:55.440 --> 37:56.040
Very well.

37:56.880 --> 37:57.670
I will...

37:57.960 --> 37:58.500
immediately

37:58.500 --> 38:00.830
write to Marquis Jingyuan and the others.

38:10.030 --> 38:10.830
Your Majesty,

38:11.480 --> 38:13.150
there is no need to be overly anxious.

38:13.150 --> 38:14.950
Matters depend on human effort.

38:15.320 --> 38:16.150
Now that

38:16.670 --> 38:18.480
I have already been accused,

38:18.630 --> 38:19.760
my mentor

38:20.230 --> 38:21.360
may lower his guard,

38:22.440 --> 38:23.570
which could instead

38:24.000 --> 38:25.530
make it easier for me to act.

38:25.710 --> 38:26.360
So,

38:26.590 --> 38:28.590
Your Majesty
only needs to respond as situations arise.

38:28.590 --> 38:29.550
Leave the rest

38:30.360 --> 38:31.370
to me.

38:32.230 --> 38:32.670
Okay.

38:33.510 --> 38:34.480
With you here,

38:34.840 --> 38:35.900
I'm always at ease.

38:40.670 --> 38:41.590
Thank you, Your Majesty.

38:41.590 --> 38:42.230
I

38:43.550 --> 38:44.610
will take my leave.

38:52.870 --> 38:56.480
[Ji Mansion]

39:15.400 --> 39:16.130
My Lord.

39:35.700 --> 39:39.530
[Balanced as stars on a tripod]

39:43.710 --> 39:44.360
My Lord,

39:45.440 --> 39:46.670
everyone in the Ji family

39:46.670 --> 39:47.590
is here.

40:00.150 --> 40:01.360
Release them!

40:01.670 --> 40:02.830
Or I'll kill you!

40:08.510 --> 40:10.310
Do you think I'm afraid of death?

40:10.920 --> 40:12.530
You madman.

40:12.630 --> 40:13.070
Yes.

40:14.230 --> 40:15.400
I am a madman.

40:17.230 --> 40:19.400
As long as I can make Chen Yanyun
bow his head—

40:19.400 --> 40:20.840
make the lofty Prime Minister Chen

40:20.840 --> 40:22.300
kneel and beg me—

40:22.710 --> 40:23.970
so what if I'm a madman?

40:24.360 --> 40:25.510
So what even if I die?

40:30.280 --> 40:32.610
He should be arriving soon, shouldn't he?

40:33.600 --> 40:36.130
Take them all
to the Court of Judicial Review!

40:38.550 --> 40:39.750
Zhao!

40:42.130 --> 40:43.930
When Chen Yanyun arrives later,

40:44.960 --> 40:46.420
ask him to kneel and beg me.

40:50.480 --> 40:51.440
Maybe...

40:51.840 --> 40:53.360
I'll let the Ji family go.

40:55.360 --> 40:56.400
Dream on!

41:15.630 --> 41:16.440
Third Master.

41:23.380 --> 41:25.960
[Balanced as stars on a tripod]

41:24.230 --> 41:24.710
My Lord,

41:24.880 --> 41:26.540
I'm only acting under orders.

41:33.960 --> 41:34.760
Yanyun!

41:35.590 --> 41:37.330
You ungrateful bastard!

41:42.270 --> 41:43.350
Save Grandmother!

41:44.710 --> 41:45.640
Are you alright?

41:46.070 --> 41:47.020
Just a scratch.

41:48.670 --> 41:50.790
[Balanced as stars on a tripod]

41:52.590 --> 41:54.190
Zhao, are you alright?

41:54.190 --> 41:54.800
I'm fine.

41:57.840 --> 41:59.020
Chen Xuanqing.

41:59.110 --> 42:01.230
I didn't expect you to be so crazy.

42:01.280 --> 42:03.050
You don't deserve to be human.

42:07.190 --> 42:07.960
Chen Yanyun,

42:08.920 --> 42:10.190
I know what you've hidden

42:10.190 --> 42:11.230
in Ji Mansion.

42:12.480 --> 42:13.400
Once my men

42:14.000 --> 42:15.540
find them,

42:16.280 --> 42:17.510
all of you will die!

42:20.280 --> 42:21.070
Really?

42:22.400 --> 42:22.880
Yes.

42:24.800 --> 42:25.480
Unless...

42:27.960 --> 42:29.320
you kneel and beg me.

42:32.030 --> 42:32.880
Kneel

42:33.200 --> 42:34.080
and beg you?

42:36.400 --> 42:36.920
Yes.

42:38.400 --> 42:39.280
Chen Yanyun,

42:39.840 --> 42:41.840
you didn't expect this day, did you?

42:49.140 --> 42:50.350
Foolish.

42:50.670 --> 42:51.320
That is precisely why

42:51.320 --> 42:53.250
I had to send you out of the capital.

42:53.440 --> 42:54.550
You know nothing

42:55.670 --> 42:57.070
of court politics.

43:00.570 --> 43:01.110
Let go!

43:00.680 --> 43:03.090
[Balanced as stars on a tripod]

43:03.440 --> 43:03.920
Let go!

43:04.070 --> 43:04.760
Let me go!

43:05.110 --> 43:05.760
Let me go!

43:05.990 --> 43:06.440
Let...

43:16.260 --> 43:17.320
What are you doing?

43:31.250 --> 43:34.920
[A Splendid Match]
